WEBVTT

00:00:00.600 --> 00:00:03.837
Choose Visits if your day takes you to
clients' homes or sites.

00:00:04.936 --> 00:00:08.414
Start with your service area and where
you'll leave from, then check your work
days.

00:00:09.614 --> 00:00:13.250
Before adding client information, check the
privacy requirements for your work.

00:00:14.150 --> 00:00:17.607
If the app asks you to review them, choose
the answer that fits your work.

00:00:18.807 --> 00:00:21.718
Add a client with their name, address and
usual visit length.

00:00:24.218 --> 00:00:25.192
Check their visit days.

00:00:26.292 --> 00:00:29.882
A visit needs to fall on both a client
visit day and one of your work days.

00:00:30.982 --> 00:00:34.699
We'll add three clients here so there's a
day to plan, not just one appointment.

00:00:35.999 --> 00:00:39.234
Check the client order and addresses in the
review, then finish setup.

00:00:40.234 --> 00:00:42.443
Open Today and Calendar to check the plan.

00:00:43.443 --> 00:00:45.779
You can set your travel buffer in Settings,
under Travel.

00:00:46.679 --> 00:00:49.918
The route follows client order; it isn't an
optimised driving route.
